sequenceDiagram
    participant UserA
    participant UserB
    participant WebApp
    participant SocketServer

    UserA->>WebApp: Connects to project
    WebApp->>SocketServer: Joins project room
    UserB->>WebApp: Connects to project
    WebApp->>SocketServer: Joins project room

    UserA->>WebApp: Adds an annotation
    WebApp->>SocketServer: Emits 'new_annotation' event with data
    SocketServer->>UserB: Broadcasts 'new_annotation' event to room
    UserB->>WebApp: Receives event and displays new annotation

    UserB->>WebApp: Adds a comment
    WebApp->>SocketServer: Emits 'new_comment' event with data
    SocketServer->>UserA: Broadcasts 'new_comment' event to room
    UserA->>WebApp: Receives event and displays new comment